{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isFinal","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A failed save is retried on a bounded backoff, so most ","type":"text"},{"code":".save","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" failures","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"arrive with this ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and are followed by a successful attempt the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app never hears about. ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" means the retry budget is spent: the value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"is still in memory and still protected from being overwritten by the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stale stored row, but it is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" on disk and nothing further will be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attempted until the entity is edited again or the app flushes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"explicitly. This is the one worth telling the user about.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Always "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"code":".fetch","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which is not retried."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:17SwiduxPersistence0B7FailureV7isFinalSbvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text